1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:12,000
"Echo Of A Letter"
(Episode 2)

2
00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:16,855
I'll take you to the VIP room. This way.

3
00:00:16,879 --> 00:00:17,879
Sounds good.

4
00:00:20,479 --> 00:00:22,359
The venues in Shenzhen are big too,

5
00:00:22,360 --> 00:00:25,000
but they lack this classic,
old-school charm Haishi has.

6
00:00:25,640 --> 00:00:27,039
As long as you enjoy it, Mr. Zhou.

7
00:00:28,399 --> 00:00:29,479
Long time no see, Mr. Chen.

8
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:30,800
This is Mr. Zhou.

9
00:00:31,279 --> 00:00:33,535
He's visiting from Shenzhen
and enjoys playing a few hands.

10
00:00:33,559 --> 00:00:35,199
Sister Yun, please take good care of him.

11
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:37,639
Is this your first time here, Mr. Zhou?

12
00:00:37,640 --> 00:00:38,360
It is.

13
00:00:38,520 --> 00:00:39,919
Then you're in for a real treat.

14
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:41,160
Right this way, please.

15
00:00:45,319 --> 00:00:46,559
- Please have a seat. - Thanks.

16
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:48,200
Mr. Chen, please take a seat.

17
00:00:49,616 --> 00:00:50,776
- Enjoy your game, gentlemen.
- Will do.

18
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:52,400
Let us know if you need anything at all.

19
00:01:05,760 --> 00:01:06,760
Raise ten thousand.

20
00:01:11,559 --> 00:01:12,319
Mr. Chen?

21
00:01:12,559 --> 00:01:13,519
Are you in?

22
00:01:13,519 --> 00:01:14,519
Of course.

23
00:01:15,559 --> 00:01:16,679
All right, let's keep going.

24
00:01:19,159 --> 00:01:20,159
Again.

25
00:01:28,519 --> 00:01:29,559
All in.

26
00:01:29,919 --> 00:01:30,400
Mr. Chen.

27
00:01:30,719 --> 00:01:31,719
Are you calling?

28
00:01:32,960 --> 00:01:34,495
I've got to follow your lead, Mr. Zhou.

29
00:01:34,519 --> 00:01:35,159
Good.

30
00:01:35,480 --> 00:01:36,480
Deal.

31
00:01:42,559 --> 00:01:43,559
Spade flush.

32
00:01:45,680 --> 00:01:47,200
Interesting.

33
00:01:47,519 --> 00:01:50,158
Thank you for going easy on me, Mr. Chen.

34
00:01:50,159 --> 00:01:50,919
Another round.

35
00:01:51,159 --> 00:01:53,096
I'm going to step out to
the restroom. Take your time.

36
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:53,680
Sure.

37
00:01:53,919 --> 00:01:54,919
Come on.

38
00:01:59,559 --> 00:02:01,479
Pardon me, sir, but a VIP has
reserved this entire floor tonight.

39
00:02:01,480 --> 00:02:03,640
You may use the restroom
on the other side. Thank you.

40
00:02:06,240 --> 00:02:07,718
Security at the VIP room is too tight.

41
00:02:07,719 --> 00:02:08,719
I can't get in.

42
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:09,519
Next time.

43
00:02:09,880 --> 00:02:11,559
Zhao Shengge won't be so lucky next time.

44
00:02:11,719 --> 00:02:12,719
Yes, sir.

45
00:02:13,200 --> 00:02:14,200
Yes, sir.

46
00:02:14,719 --> 00:02:15,439
Understood.

47
00:02:15,439 --> 00:02:16,439
Understood.

48
00:02:24,679 --> 00:02:26,760
So he's the VIP who
booked the floor tonight.

49
00:02:27,320 --> 00:02:28,320
Going after him?

50
00:02:28,600 --> 00:02:29,600
You have a death wish.

51
00:02:30,399 --> 00:02:30,959
I understand.

52
00:02:31,359 --> 00:02:31,799
Right, right.

53
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:33,615
Next time, I'll make sure he ends up dead.

54
00:02:33,639 --> 00:02:34,639
Yes, sir.

55
00:02:55,720 --> 00:02:56,720
What are you doing?

56
00:02:56,919 --> 00:02:57,280
Hurry!

57
00:02:57,519 --> 00:02:59,600
Damn it, open the door!

58
00:03:00,200 --> 00:03:01,200
Mr. Chen.

59
00:03:01,320 --> 00:03:03,280
You didn't tell me he was back.

60
00:03:04,239 --> 00:03:05,239
Yes.

61
00:03:06,079 --> 00:03:07,079
He's back.

62
00:03:08,119 --> 00:03:10,679
Though it shouldn't
change my life all that much.

63
00:03:11,119 --> 00:03:12,280
The joy and the sorrow,

64
00:03:12,760 --> 00:03:14,040
the satisfaction and the unease,

65
00:03:15,040 --> 00:03:16,079
they all belong to me.

66
00:03:16,560 --> 00:03:18,200
I am in control of everything.

67
00:03:18,760 --> 00:03:20,919
Everything is mine to decide.

68
00:03:21,359 --> 00:03:23,839
Are you sure his presence won't affect you?

69
00:03:25,359 --> 00:03:26,359
It won't.

70
00:03:29,239 --> 00:03:31,358
I had a wonderful time tonight.

71
00:03:31,359 --> 00:03:33,600
You're truly a fascinating man, Mr. Chen.

72
00:03:34,959 --> 00:03:37,199
As long as you enjoyed
yourself. Safe travels, Mr. Zhou.

73
00:03:37,359 --> 00:03:38,359
Take care.

74
00:05:20,880 --> 00:05:22,120
Has that guy lost his mind?

75
00:06:09,760 --> 00:06:11,200
He's still got some temper.

76
00:06:53,680 --> 00:06:54,680
Wan.

77
00:06:57,159 --> 00:06:58,159
Have you eaten?

78
00:06:59,719 --> 00:07:00,719
I have.

79
00:07:02,159 --> 00:07:03,440
Look at that miserable face.

80
00:07:03,839 --> 00:07:05,439
Does that look like someone who's eaten?

81
00:07:10,320 --> 00:07:11,120
This bowl right here...

82
00:07:11,121 --> 00:07:12,319
Back when we first met,

83
00:07:12,320 --> 00:07:13,398
you dragged me to that street stall,

84
00:07:13,399 --> 00:07:15,120
and I devoured three bowls in a row,

85
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:16,398
nearly bursting my gut.

86
00:07:16,399 --> 00:07:18,399
You blew through every
last cent of your allowance

87
00:07:18,639 --> 00:07:20,279
and still owed the owner three bucks.

88
00:07:23,719 --> 00:07:25,199
How long has it been since you slept?

89
00:07:28,320 --> 00:07:29,320
I did sleep.

90
00:07:33,399 --> 00:07:34,399
For how long?

91
00:07:55,440 --> 00:07:56,440
Chen Wan.

92
00:07:57,039 --> 00:07:58,399
Do you take me for a fool?

93
00:08:03,360 --> 00:08:04,439
Ever since that year,

94
00:08:04,440 --> 00:08:06,158
when Zhuo Shengyan shoved me into the water

95
00:08:06,159 --> 00:08:08,439
and everyone just stood
by watching the spectacle,

96
00:08:08,440 --> 00:08:09,838
you were the only one
who jumped in to save me.

97
00:08:09,839 --> 00:08:11,120
From that moment on,

98
00:08:11,440 --> 00:08:13,839
I've considered you my very best friend.

99
00:08:14,560 --> 00:08:15,560
What about you?

100
00:08:15,719 --> 00:08:17,279
What do you really think in your heart?

101
00:08:17,519 --> 00:08:18,959
Do you even consider me a friend?

102
00:08:24,639 --> 00:08:25,680
I've always known

103
00:08:26,560 --> 00:08:27,360
the kind of person you are.

104
00:08:27,361 --> 00:08:28,721
You seem easygoing on the surface,

105
00:08:28,959 --> 00:08:30,200
but you're stubborn to a fault.

106
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:32,015
Once you set your mind on something,

107
00:08:32,039 --> 00:08:33,039
or someone,

108
00:08:33,159 --> 00:08:34,839
wild horses couldn't drag you away.

109
00:08:35,599 --> 00:08:36,839
Ever since he came back,

110
00:08:37,079 --> 00:08:38,439
no matter where he is or how far it is,

111
00:08:38,440 --> 00:08:40,120
you rush right over,

112
00:08:40,880 --> 00:08:42,280
only to miss him almost every time.

113
00:08:42,599 --> 00:08:44,680
Then you come back
and work around the clock.

114
00:08:44,920 --> 00:08:46,440
I'm not telling you to give up on him,

115
00:08:47,440 --> 00:08:48,799
but at least promise me

116
00:08:48,800 --> 00:08:50,400
you'll take care of your health.

117
00:08:57,759 --> 00:08:58,999
What do you even see in him?

118
00:09:03,040 --> 00:09:05,759
Everything. And the fact that
he doesn't know is the best part.

119
00:09:09,200 --> 00:09:10,200
Best part, my foot!

120
00:09:10,440 --> 00:09:11,440
What's good about that?

121
00:09:12,599 --> 00:09:14,239
Just catching a glimpse of him is enough.

122
00:09:16,200 --> 00:09:18,920
Even if it's only once out of ten attempts...?

123
00:09:27,680 --> 00:09:28,680
Xuan,

124
00:09:28,759 --> 00:09:29,759
you know what?

125
00:09:31,239 --> 00:09:32,319
In the end, I live in a world

126
00:09:32,320 --> 00:09:33,839
where Zhao Shengge doesn't belong.

127
00:09:35,239 --> 00:09:36,239
He's at the mountaintop,

128
00:09:36,599 --> 00:09:38,039
and I'm at the bottom of the valley.

129
00:09:39,479 --> 00:09:41,359
Seeing him from afar is all I ask for.

130
00:09:42,680 --> 00:09:44,760
Even if I only catch a
glimpse once every ten times,

131
00:09:45,680 --> 00:09:46,960
I already consider myself lucky.

132
00:09:48,440 --> 00:09:49,440
Chen Wan.

133
00:09:51,320 --> 00:09:52,838
What if Zhao Shengge finds out one day?

134
00:09:52,839 --> 00:09:53,839
He won't.

135
00:09:55,119 --> 00:09:56,399
As long as he's safe and sound

136
00:09:56,400 --> 00:09:58,400
and out there in this
world, that's enough for me.

137
00:10:07,680 --> 00:10:09,640
Enough, my foot!

138
00:10:11,719 --> 00:10:12,879
Now hurry up and eat.

139
00:10:17,359 --> 00:10:18,999
I opened a new hotel on Miwang Road.

140
00:10:19,839 --> 00:10:21,040
I've invited

141
00:10:21,320 --> 00:10:22,520
all the young heirs in Haishi.

142
00:10:23,040 --> 00:10:24,040
This Saturday,

143
00:10:24,680 --> 00:10:25,920
you have to be there.

144
00:10:27,520 --> 00:10:29,120
A feng shui master did a reading for me.

145
00:10:29,599 --> 00:10:30,839
I need someone with

146
00:10:31,119 --> 00:10:33,040
a Wu-Wu Water destiny
to preside over the venue.

147
00:10:33,560 --> 00:10:34,999
Dragon-Wood alignment,

148
00:10:36,040 --> 00:10:37,440
blessed with thriving lunar energy.

149
00:10:38,520 --> 00:10:39,520
That's literally you.

150
00:10:41,280 --> 00:10:42,640
Businessmen in Haishi

151
00:10:43,479 --> 00:10:45,159
all seem obsessed with this sort of thing.

152
00:10:45,839 --> 00:10:47,239
You have no idea.

153
00:10:47,800 --> 00:10:50,118
Zhuo Yujian and Zhuo Shengyan,

154
00:10:50,119 --> 00:10:52,239
they've been waiting on
the sidelines to see me fail.

155
00:10:52,920 --> 00:10:55,200
I have to show them
my clout and connections.

156
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:56,440
Don't worry.

157
00:10:56,560 --> 00:10:57,560
I'll be there.

158
00:11:00,119 --> 00:11:01,320
I invited Zhao Shengge too,

159
00:11:02,400 --> 00:11:03,880
though I don't know if he'll show up.

160
00:11:05,759 --> 00:11:07,200
I've already seen him once.

161
00:11:08,920 --> 00:11:10,960
Even if I miss him the
other nine times, it's fine.

162
00:11:15,119 --> 00:11:16,119
I just don't get you.

163
00:11:18,920 --> 00:11:20,399
Once you meet the right person,

164
00:11:20,400 --> 00:11:21,479
you'll understand.

165
00:11:31,599 --> 00:11:34,199
The menu for this private dining
room must be curated separately.

166
00:11:34,400 --> 00:11:36,520
Choose dishes with authentic local flavors.

167
00:11:36,920 --> 00:11:38,560
Nothing flashy that lacks real substance.

168
00:11:38,680 --> 00:11:40,520
Keep it homestyle, but
make sure it's genuine.

169
00:11:40,599 --> 00:11:40,999
Understood.

170
00:11:41,079 --> 00:11:42,640
This table is for close friends.

171
00:11:42,999 --> 00:11:43,959
Have the Italian chef

172
00:11:43,960 --> 00:11:45,919
and the seven-star master
chef from the mainland

173
00:11:45,920 --> 00:11:48,200
prepare the meal alongside the local cooks.

174
00:11:49,800 --> 00:11:51,119
The temperature in this room,

175
00:11:51,359 --> 00:11:52,359
the humidity,

176
00:11:52,640 --> 00:11:54,680
the choice of tea, teaware,
and fruit arrangements—

177
00:11:54,800 --> 00:11:55,919
set them up exactly
as I instructed earlier.

178
00:11:55,920 --> 00:11:56,320
Will do.

179
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:57,440
By the way,

180
00:11:57,520 --> 00:11:58,079
Xuan,

181
00:11:58,520 --> 00:12:00,998
that rare Da Hong Pao
tea you've been hoarding—

182
00:12:00,999 --> 00:12:02,519
time to bring it out, don't you think?

183
00:12:03,520 --> 00:12:04,520
Use it.

184
00:12:04,521 --> 00:12:05,559
Use it, by all means!

185
00:12:05,560 --> 00:12:06,999
If not now, when?

186
00:12:11,359 --> 00:12:12,359
These guests

187
00:12:12,440 --> 00:12:13,440
will sit here.

188
00:12:13,800 --> 00:12:15,200
They're close with the Zhuo family,

189
00:12:15,239 --> 00:12:16,400
so it'll be easy to mingle.

190
00:12:17,079 --> 00:12:19,040
These guests can sit over here.

191
00:12:20,239 --> 00:12:21,079
The view is great,

192
00:12:21,239 --> 00:12:22,399
and they prefer a quiet spot.

193
00:12:23,079 --> 00:12:23,520
All right.

194
00:12:23,521 --> 00:12:24,919
I'll arrange it just like that.

195
00:12:24,920 --> 00:12:25,560
Thank you.

196
00:12:25,719 --> 00:12:26,758
Let me know if anything comes up.

197
00:12:26,759 --> 00:12:27,759
Will do.

198
00:12:33,599 --> 00:12:34,839
What are you staring at me for?

199
00:12:36,920 --> 00:12:37,800
Zhao Shengge

200
00:12:37,800 --> 00:12:38,800
is completely blind.

201
00:12:38,959 --> 00:12:40,279
He doesn't notice a single thing.

202
00:12:42,160 --> 00:12:43,238
Stop worrying about me.

203
00:12:43,239 --> 00:12:44,399
Worry about yourself instead.

204
00:12:52,999 --> 00:12:54,118
My guess is

205
00:12:54,119 --> 00:12:55,599
he won't be coming today either.

206
00:12:55,959 --> 00:12:58,079
Word is he flew to
Manchester to close a deal.

207
00:12:59,879 --> 00:13:00,879
It doesn't matter.

208
00:13:02,200 --> 00:13:03,360
I'm only here to support you.

209
00:13:10,839 --> 00:13:11,839
Ms. Chen.

210
00:13:16,359 --> 00:13:17,359
How have you been?

211
00:13:17,640 --> 00:13:18,400
Long time no see.

212
00:13:18,520 --> 00:13:20,078
Young Master Zhuo, long time no see.

213
00:13:20,079 --> 00:13:20,999
Enjoy the food and drinks.

214
00:13:20,999 --> 00:13:21,999
Over this way.

215
00:13:32,959 --> 00:13:34,800
Young Master Tan, Young Master Shen!

216
00:13:36,200 --> 00:13:38,560
What an honor to have you
both grace us with your presence!

217
00:13:39,040 --> 00:13:39,999
Since it's your party,

218
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:41,120
we had to show up in person.

219
00:13:41,719 --> 00:13:42,640
We need everyone to know

220
00:13:42,641 --> 00:13:44,320
that our boy Xuan has serious backing.

221
00:13:44,959 --> 00:13:45,959
Hello, Mr. Chen.

222
00:14:16,400 --> 00:14:17,400
Congratulations.

223
00:14:17,800 --> 00:14:18,800
Thank you.

224
00:14:19,440 --> 00:14:20,520
You arrived right on time.

225
00:14:20,680 --> 00:14:21,776
Dinner's about to be served.

226
00:14:21,800 --> 00:14:23,319
Let me tell you, our table tonight

227
00:14:23,320 --> 00:14:25,040
is completely different from the rest.

228
00:14:25,400 --> 00:14:26,640
Wan put so much thought into...

229
00:14:29,800 --> 00:14:30,119
What?

230
00:14:30,119 --> 00:14:31,119
Off in a daze again?

231
00:14:32,079 --> 00:14:32,479
No,

232
00:14:32,480 --> 00:14:33,695
I just meant food's on the way.

233
00:14:33,719 --> 00:14:34,719
Let's head in.

234
00:14:35,640 --> 00:14:36,640
Let's go.

235
00:14:43,879 --> 00:14:44,719
Seriously?

236
00:14:44,720 --> 00:14:46,119
Seafood congee again?

237
00:14:46,359 --> 00:14:48,160
I'm sick of this stuff.

238
00:14:48,839 --> 00:14:49,839
You might be sick of it,

239
00:14:49,879 --> 00:14:50,879
but someone isn't.

240
00:14:55,400 --> 00:14:58,119
Why are all these fruits
Zhao Shengge's favorites?

241
00:14:58,520 --> 00:14:59,200
Really?

242
00:14:59,479 --> 00:15:01,160
What a coincidence.

243
00:15:01,800 --> 00:15:02,800
Youming,

244
00:15:02,839 --> 00:15:05,239
your private club really
needs to step up its service.

245
00:15:06,479 --> 00:15:07,479
Oh, come on.

246
00:15:07,640 --> 00:15:09,360
My friends are just kind enough to drop by.

247
00:15:13,759 --> 00:15:15,680
Well, they certainly
show you plenty of love.

248
00:15:17,200 --> 00:15:18,200
Ying,

249
00:15:18,239 --> 00:15:19,479
you've been swamped lately.

250
00:15:19,719 --> 00:15:22,239
Aren't you curating the exhibition
for Rong Bao Zhai's auction?

251
00:15:22,879 --> 00:15:24,639
You're always in the
loop, Young Master Tan.

252
00:15:25,079 --> 00:15:27,095
This session is exclusively
for blue-and-white porcelain.

253
00:15:27,119 --> 00:15:27,359
Why?

254
00:15:27,999 --> 00:15:30,039
Are you interested in
blue-and-white porcelain too?

255
00:15:30,719 --> 00:15:31,719
Not in the slightest.

256
00:15:31,800 --> 00:15:32,958
Couldn't care less.

257
00:15:32,959 --> 00:15:34,520
Zhao Shengge's the one who'd care.

258
00:15:35,119 --> 00:15:36,679
His family loves collecting that stuff.

259
00:15:37,239 --> 00:15:39,519
What was it called... the
Phantom Cloud Crane?

260
00:15:39,520 --> 00:15:41,200
Might belong to one of the triad factions.

261
00:15:42,160 --> 00:15:43,199
Supposedly, one faction

262
00:15:43,200 --> 00:15:44,999
has already split down the middle.

263
00:15:45,400 --> 00:15:46,799
The second-in-command wants to take over,

264
00:15:46,800 --> 00:15:48,000
but the men don't respect him.

265
00:15:49,560 --> 00:15:50,838
I heard Mrs. Mak

266
00:15:50,839 --> 00:15:54,080
still goes to stage a protest outside Minglong
Tower every day, screaming for justice.

267
00:15:56,280 --> 00:15:58,040
She had been quiet for a few days.

268
00:15:58,479 --> 00:16:00,159
Making a scene out of nowhere like this...

269
00:16:00,160 --> 00:16:01,600
someone must be pulling her strings.

270
00:16:02,400 --> 00:16:04,200
If there's no conspiracy here,

271
00:16:04,400 --> 00:16:05,920
my name isn't Zhuo.

272
00:16:06,400 --> 00:16:07,400
Not Zhuo?

273
00:16:08,359 --> 00:16:09,759
Then take my name and be a Tan.

274
00:16:10,959 --> 00:16:13,559
The latest rumor is that right
before Mak Ka Fai jumped,

275
00:16:13,560 --> 00:16:15,598
the last call he received
was from Zhao Shengge.

276
00:16:15,599 --> 00:16:17,359
Now everyone in Haishi is paranoid,

277
00:16:17,759 --> 00:16:20,560
terrified of getting a
death call from Mr. Zhao.

278
00:16:25,440 --> 00:16:26,520
I never made that call.

279
00:16:28,320 --> 00:16:30,920
We merely chose different
ways to fulfill the contract.

280
00:16:32,119 --> 00:16:33,839
I knew those tabloids were full of garbage.

281
00:16:34,079 --> 00:16:35,575
They spin the most ridiculous stories.

282
00:16:35,599 --> 00:16:37,799
Why would Shengge
ever make a call like that?

283
00:16:37,800 --> 00:16:38,800
Wan.

284
00:16:39,239 --> 00:16:40,239
What?

285
00:16:40,719 --> 00:16:41,719
Spooked?

286
00:16:41,999 --> 00:16:43,440
Do you really think

287
00:16:44,280 --> 00:16:46,040
he was the one who killed Mak Ka Fai?

288
00:16:47,839 --> 00:16:48,839
No.

289
00:16:49,920 --> 00:16:51,320
Mr. Zhao isn't that kind of person.

290
00:17:04,239 --> 00:17:05,239
Mr. Zhao.

291
00:17:05,280 --> 00:17:06,679
Officer He has been contacted.

292
00:17:06,680 --> 00:17:08,320
Should we continue looking into Mr. Chen?

293
00:17:08,759 --> 00:17:10,598
This tea tastes pretty good,

294
00:17:10,599 --> 00:17:12,479
though compared to the
one at Shengge's office,

295
00:17:12,759 --> 00:17:13,640
it's a little light.

296
00:17:13,680 --> 00:17:14,760
Continue the investigation.

297
00:17:16,319 --> 00:17:17,719
I think it's just right.

298
00:17:18,239 --> 00:17:19,616
Your stomach's been acting up lately.

299
00:17:19,640 --> 00:17:20,896
You should cut down on strong tea.

300
00:17:20,920 --> 00:17:21,920
This is ideal for you.

301
00:17:22,319 --> 00:17:23,319
Lucas.

302
00:17:23,799 --> 00:17:24,519
Mr. Tan.

303
00:17:24,719 --> 00:17:26,360
Your boss has a sensitive stomach.

304
00:17:26,400 --> 00:17:27,576
Stop brewing his tea so strong.

305
00:17:27,600 --> 00:17:28,920
Take a leaf out of Wan's book.

306
00:17:29,319 --> 00:17:30,200
You're right, Mr. Tan.

307
00:17:30,200 --> 00:17:31,200
My oversight.

308
00:17:31,239 --> 00:17:32,518
You flatter me, Mr. Tan.

309
00:17:32,519 --> 00:17:34,120
Who am I to teach anyone?

310
00:17:34,400 --> 00:17:35,400
Just a coincidence.

311
00:17:45,640 --> 00:17:46,120
Cheers!

312
00:17:46,120 --> 00:17:46,999
Cheers!

313
00:17:46,999 --> 00:17:47,999
Cheers!

314
00:17:48,279 --> 00:17:49,279
Mr. Zhao.

315
00:17:49,360 --> 00:17:50,800
We look forward to working with you.

316
00:17:51,279 --> 00:17:52,295
Here's to plenty of future collaborations.

317
00:17:52,319 --> 00:17:53,680
Cheers!

318
00:17:54,920 --> 00:17:56,080
Go on over!

319
00:17:56,440 --> 00:17:57,518
This is your chance

320
00:17:57,519 --> 00:17:59,199
to raise a glass with him out in the open.

321
00:17:59,479 --> 00:18:00,319
Mr. Zhao.

322
00:18:00,319 --> 00:18:01,319
A toast to you.

323
00:18:01,799 --> 00:18:02,920
Go on.

324
00:18:06,120 --> 00:18:06,840
All right.

325
00:18:06,841 --> 00:18:09,038
Cheers!

326
00:18:09,039 --> 00:18:09,519
Cheers.

327
00:18:09,719 --> 00:18:11,519
Mr. Zhao, please keep us in mind.

328
00:18:14,519 --> 00:18:16,159
Mr. Zhao, here's to you.

329
00:18:16,160 --> 00:18:17,160
Cheers.

330
00:18:21,039 --> 00:18:22,039
Let's head out.

331
00:18:22,959 --> 00:18:23,959
Leaving already?

332
00:18:36,840 --> 00:18:38,320
Why didn't you touch your food today?

333
00:18:38,559 --> 00:18:39,839
Was the food not to your liking?

334
00:18:40,999 --> 00:18:41,559
Or was it...

335
00:18:41,880 --> 00:18:42,880
not the right mood?

336
00:18:44,519 --> 00:18:45,519
I'm fine.

337
00:18:49,080 --> 00:18:51,719
Remember to call me
whenever a deal comes up!

338
00:19:16,360 --> 00:19:17,360
Mr. Chen.

339
00:19:18,160 --> 00:19:19,160
Mr. Chen.

340
00:19:22,120 --> 00:19:23,400
Sorry to bother you again today.

341
00:19:24,880 --> 00:19:25,880
Don't mention it.

342
00:19:25,959 --> 00:19:26,959
By the way,

343
00:19:28,799 --> 00:19:30,478
could you please wrap this up

344
00:19:30,479 --> 00:19:31,919
and hand it to Mr. Zhao's assistant?

345
00:19:32,279 --> 00:19:33,039
Certainly, Mr. Chen.

346
00:19:33,200 --> 00:19:34,240
I'll see to it right away.

347
00:19:34,559 --> 00:19:35,559
Great, thank you.

348
00:19:53,559 --> 00:19:54,559
Chen Wan.

349
00:19:54,999 --> 00:19:56,080
I forgot my lighter.

350
00:19:58,999 --> 00:19:59,999
Mr. Chen.

351
00:20:00,360 --> 00:20:01,360
Mr. Chen.

352
00:20:04,200 --> 00:20:05,200
I couldn't find him.

353
00:20:05,400 --> 00:20:06,480
I wasn't able to reach him.

354
00:20:07,200 --> 00:20:08,200
It's all right.

355
00:20:08,279 --> 00:20:09,959
This guest is hard to track down.

356
00:20:10,440 --> 00:20:11,200
Just give it to me.

357
00:20:11,200 --> 00:20:12,200
Thank you for trying.

358
00:20:24,080 --> 00:20:24,680
Boss,

359
00:20:24,999 --> 00:20:25,999
should we get going?

360
00:20:27,959 --> 00:20:28,959
Hold on a second.

361
00:20:31,999 --> 00:20:33,639
This restaurant of yours is top-notch.

362
00:20:33,640 --> 00:20:34,319
I see big things ahead for you.

363
00:20:34,319 --> 00:20:35,319
A very bright future.

364
00:20:36,920 --> 00:20:37,440
Mr. Zhuo,

365
00:20:37,799 --> 00:20:38,319
I'll be taking my leave.

366
00:20:38,519 --> 00:20:39,160
It was an absolute pleasure having you.

367
00:20:39,160 --> 00:20:40,160
Come back soon!

368
00:20:42,039 --> 00:20:43,039
Xuan.

369
00:20:44,319 --> 00:20:45,319
What?

370
00:20:45,799 --> 00:20:47,039
The cigarette case and lighter.

371
00:20:47,279 --> 00:20:49,119
Could you return these
to Zhao Shengge for me?

372
00:20:52,360 --> 00:20:54,239
Why don't you hand them to him yourself?

373
00:20:56,200 --> 00:20:57,200
No need.

374
00:20:57,479 --> 00:20:58,680
If he asks,

375
00:20:58,799 --> 00:21:00,376
don't tell him I was the
one who found them.

376
00:21:00,400 --> 00:21:01,600
Just say you found them.

377
00:21:01,999 --> 00:21:02,999
Don't bring my name up at all.

378
00:21:03,000 --> 00:21:04,080
Are you out of your mind?

379
00:21:04,880 --> 00:21:07,520
No need, no need, no need! And
yet you're head over heels for him!

380
00:21:08,360 --> 00:21:09,479
I do like him,

381
00:21:10,319 --> 00:21:12,199
but that doesn't mean
I'm trying to pursue him.

382
00:21:14,799 --> 00:21:15,799
Still,

383
00:21:16,999 --> 00:21:17,999
have you really

384
00:21:18,080 --> 00:21:19,160
never thought about it?

385
00:21:20,999 --> 00:21:22,400
Doing all this for him,

386
00:21:22,759 --> 00:21:23,999
like it's some sort of charity?

387
00:21:24,640 --> 00:21:26,478
I'm not trying to win him over.

388
00:21:26,479 --> 00:21:29,120
Wanting to look at him from afar

389
00:21:29,239 --> 00:21:31,399
and doing a little something
for someone I care about—

390
00:21:31,440 --> 00:21:32,760
they don't contradict each other.

391
00:21:35,640 --> 00:21:35,999
Fine.

392
00:21:36,600 --> 00:21:37,600
Great.

393
00:21:37,840 --> 00:21:39,320
Whatever you say, Mr. Philanthropist.

394
00:21:40,880 --> 00:21:41,400
All right.

395
00:21:41,479 --> 00:21:42,080
I'll take off now.

396
00:21:42,200 --> 00:21:42,519
See you.

397
00:21:42,999 --> 00:21:43,999
Bye.

398
00:21:56,920 --> 00:21:57,920
Shengge!

399
00:21:58,319 --> 00:21:59,319
Where are you?

400
00:22:00,400 --> 00:22:01,160
You haven't left yet?

401
00:22:01,400 --> 00:22:02,400
Great.

402
00:22:02,519 --> 00:22:02,840
Good.

403
00:22:03,120 --> 00:22:04,120
Wait up for me.

404
00:22:15,559 --> 00:22:16,120
What's up?

405
00:22:16,519 --> 00:22:17,559
Well, um...

406
00:22:17,880 --> 00:22:18,920
I was just about to leave,

407
00:22:19,160 --> 00:22:20,160
and I noticed you...

408
00:22:20,200 --> 00:22:21,200
you left this behind.

409
00:22:21,200 --> 00:22:22,200
So...

410
00:22:22,440 --> 00:22:23,880
good thing you hadn't taken off yet.

411
00:22:31,400 --> 00:22:32,400
After all these years,

412
00:22:33,039 --> 00:22:34,039
Zhuo Zhixuan,

413
00:22:34,640 --> 00:22:35,799
you haven't changed one bit.

414
00:22:37,120 --> 00:22:38,279
Did you find this?

415
00:22:39,360 --> 00:22:40,360
Yeah.

416
00:22:50,880 --> 00:22:51,880
Cheers.

417
00:22:54,279 --> 00:22:55,279
Is that so?

418
00:22:55,319 --> 00:22:56,319
Yeah.

419
00:22:57,160 --> 00:22:58,440
How could it not be?

420
00:22:59,719 --> 00:23:00,920
Thanks for the trouble.

421
00:23:01,519 --> 00:23:02,519
No problem at all.

422
00:23:04,799 --> 00:23:05,799
Nice hotel.

423
00:23:05,920 --> 00:23:06,960
Wishing you great fortune.

424
00:23:07,279 --> 00:23:08,279
Come back anytime!

425
00:23:14,039 --> 00:23:15,039
Let's roll.

426
00:23:32,519 --> 00:23:33,519
Chen Wan!

427
00:23:33,559 --> 00:23:35,319
You scared the living daylights out of me!

428
00:23:35,479 --> 00:23:37,680
Making me lie to Zhao Shengge's face!

429
00:23:38,719 --> 00:23:40,559
I swear I owe you big time in this life.

430
00:23:41,120 --> 00:23:42,359
I owe you my life,

431
00:23:42,360 --> 00:23:44,120
and I must have owed
you in a past life too.

432
00:23:45,959 --> 00:23:47,959
You'd better figure out
how you're paying me back.

433
00:23:52,959 --> 00:23:55,239
Did you ever get that beat-up BYD fixed?

434
00:23:55,479 --> 00:23:56,039
It's fixed.

435
00:23:56,400 --> 00:23:58,440
I've already driven it out
to handle the paperwork.

436
00:24:01,600 --> 00:24:02,600
Pull over.

437
00:24:02,840 --> 00:24:03,840
Stop here?

438
00:24:04,039 --> 00:24:05,039
That's right.

439
00:24:05,999 --> 00:24:06,999
Boss,

440
00:24:07,039 --> 00:24:08,215
our schedule to get to Yingchi

441
00:24:08,239 --> 00:24:09,239
is getting pretty tight.

442
00:24:09,920 --> 00:24:10,920
It's fine.

443
00:24:13,360 --> 00:24:14,160
Your car might be old,

444
00:24:14,161 --> 00:24:15,758
but it's still known for
being a durable runabout.

445
00:24:15,759 --> 00:24:17,639
How on earth did you manage
to run the engine so red-hot?

446
00:24:17,640 --> 00:24:18,799
Ran into a lunatic.

447
00:24:23,479 --> 00:24:24,479
Zhao Shengge?

448
00:24:24,640 --> 00:24:25,200
I've got something to take care of.

449
00:24:25,519 --> 00:24:26,519
Talk to you later.

450
00:24:49,719 --> 00:24:50,719
Mr. Zhao.

451
00:24:51,039 --> 00:24:52,039
Chen Wan.

452
00:24:52,120 --> 00:24:54,559
We met at Young Master
Zhuo's hotel last time.

453
00:24:58,160 --> 00:24:59,200
Car trouble?

454
00:25:02,080 --> 00:25:02,999
Are you in a rush?

455
00:25:03,000 --> 00:25:04,920
If you're in a hurry, you can take my car.

456
00:25:05,440 --> 00:25:06,440
Would that be alright?

457
00:25:06,680 --> 00:25:07,360
Where are you headed?

458
00:25:07,640 --> 00:25:08,640
Yingchi.

459
00:25:08,920 --> 00:25:10,440
I'll take you there. This way.

460
00:25:38,959 --> 00:25:39,440
Mr. Zhao,

461
00:25:39,719 --> 00:25:40,880
apologies for the small car.

462
00:25:41,719 --> 00:25:43,279
There's bottled water right beside you.

463
00:25:43,600 --> 00:25:44,600
Thank you.

464
00:25:46,920 --> 00:25:48,840
Mr. Zhao, is the AC comfortable?

465
00:26:38,519 --> 00:26:39,239
Hello?

466
00:26:40,239 --> 00:26:40,799
Stuck in traffic.

467
00:26:41,239 --> 00:26:42,239
Be right there.

468
00:26:58,640 --> 00:27:00,200
Don't drop me off at the main entrance.

469
00:27:01,239 --> 00:27:03,080
Which entrance would you prefer?

470
00:27:03,680 --> 00:27:05,400
Where do you think would be best?

471
00:27:05,600 --> 00:27:06,720
Wherever parking is easiest,

472
00:27:06,880 --> 00:27:07,880
drop me off there.

473
00:27:10,279 --> 00:27:12,319
Water Gate, Rain Gate, Kun Gate.

474
00:27:12,999 --> 00:27:14,440
Water Gate is the central hub.

475
00:27:14,719 --> 00:27:16,600
Step right in and
there's a private elevator.

476
00:27:16,920 --> 00:27:18,440
He can reach anywhere from there.

477
00:27:18,479 --> 00:27:19,479
It's the most convenient.

478
00:27:20,559 --> 00:27:22,120
Then I'll drop you off at Water Gate.

479
00:27:22,239 --> 00:27:23,879
It's easy to get anywhere from that gate.

480
00:27:24,680 --> 00:27:25,959
You know quite a lot.

481
00:27:27,319 --> 00:27:28,319
Thanks.

482
00:27:32,479 --> 00:27:33,519
Take care, Mr. Zhao.

483
00:28:00,559 --> 00:28:01,559
Head to Kun Gate.

484
00:28:03,039 --> 00:28:04,680
Any updates on Chen Wan?

485
00:28:13,640 --> 00:28:14,640
Mr. Zhao.

486
00:28:16,160 --> 00:28:17,160
Mr. Shao.

487
00:28:18,319 --> 00:28:19,319
No assistant today?

488
00:28:19,559 --> 00:28:20,559
Not necessary.

489
00:28:20,640 --> 00:28:21,640
Very well.

490
00:28:27,759 --> 00:28:28,360
Pour the wine.

491
00:28:28,640 --> 00:28:29,640
Pour a glass.

492
00:28:32,239 --> 00:28:33,840
Not to your liking, Mr. Zhao?

493
00:28:34,400 --> 00:28:36,120
I picked this out specially for you.

494
00:28:36,239 --> 00:28:37,359
Thoughtful of you, Mr. Shao.

495
00:28:41,840 --> 00:28:42,840
Mr. Zhao.

496
00:28:45,279 --> 00:28:46,559
Roll your sleeves down.

497
00:28:50,479 --> 00:28:51,479
Mr. Zhao.

498
00:28:56,840 --> 00:28:57,959
I heard

499
00:28:58,039 --> 00:28:59,759
your boss passed away a couple of days ago.

500
00:29:00,799 --> 00:29:01,999
Life is unpredictable.

501
00:29:02,719 --> 00:29:04,440
Those of us who answered to him

502
00:29:04,759 --> 00:29:06,160
are feeling quite uneasy.

503
00:29:07,120 --> 00:29:09,039
Times are tough for business.

504
00:29:09,519 --> 00:29:10,616
It all depends on whether you, Mr. Zhao,

505
00:29:10,640 --> 00:29:12,160
are willing to throw us a bone.

506
00:29:12,680 --> 00:29:14,360
I do have an option for you,

507
00:29:14,559 --> 00:29:16,775
though I'm not sure if you're
willing to take it, Mr. Shao.

508
00:29:16,799 --> 00:29:18,176
If you're willing to do us this honor,

509
00:29:18,200 --> 00:29:20,238
please, enlighten me. What path is it?

510
00:29:20,239 --> 00:29:22,959
All roads lead to Lai Chi Wun.

511
00:29:39,239 --> 00:29:40,239
Back there...

512
00:29:40,959 --> 00:29:42,759
I seemed totally normal, right?

513
00:29:50,799 --> 00:29:51,839
Surviving on these streets

514
00:29:52,360 --> 00:29:53,718
is all about showing each other respect.

515
00:29:53,719 --> 00:29:54,880
That beats bloodshed any day.

516
00:29:55,640 --> 00:29:57,159
A smooth handover of Lai Chi Wun—

517
00:29:57,160 --> 00:29:58,559
that was my boss's dying wish.

518
00:29:59,039 --> 00:30:00,039
Fulfilling his wish

519
00:30:00,479 --> 00:30:01,920
rests entirely on my shoulders.

520
00:30:02,519 --> 00:30:04,399
Reclaiming land in Lai
Chi Vun to build a port—

521
00:30:04,799 --> 00:30:06,399
that's a venture that benefits everyone.

522
00:30:08,799 --> 00:30:09,959
As for me,

523
00:30:10,479 --> 00:30:12,399
making my way in the
underworld all these years,

524
00:30:13,160 --> 00:30:14,200
I have only one rule:

525
00:30:14,600 --> 00:30:15,840
peace is paramount.

526
00:30:16,440 --> 00:30:17,160
However,

527
00:30:17,239 --> 00:30:18,039
the money...

528
00:30:18,039 --> 00:30:19,039
you'll get your full cut.

529
00:30:20,840 --> 00:30:23,040
Doing business with you is
always a pleasure, Mr. Zhao.

530
00:30:26,039 --> 00:30:26,479
Mr. Zhao,

531
00:30:26,880 --> 00:30:28,720
I've also lined up some
entertainment for you.

532
00:30:29,200 --> 00:30:30,320
All gorgeous young beauties.

533
00:30:30,479 --> 00:30:31,319
I have other business to attend to.

534
00:30:31,320 --> 00:30:32,400
I won't intrude any longer.

535
00:30:32,600 --> 00:30:33,039
Mr. Zhao.

536
00:30:33,319 --> 00:30:34,959
Are they not your type, or...

537
00:30:35,400 --> 00:30:36,520
is your heart already taken?

538
00:30:36,799 --> 00:30:37,958
If someone already holds your heart,

539
00:30:37,959 --> 00:30:39,238
then please excuse my lack of tact.

540
00:30:39,239 --> 00:30:40,239
Forgive my presumption.

541
00:30:40,640 --> 00:30:42,440
You're overthinking it, Mr. Shao.

542
00:30:43,039 --> 00:30:44,519
Just deliver on your end of the deal,

543
00:30:44,920 --> 00:30:46,320
and you'll have earned your reward.

544
00:30:47,840 --> 00:30:48,440
Let me walk you out.

545
00:30:48,759 --> 00:30:49,440
No need.

546
00:30:49,680 --> 00:30:50,840
Nonsense, I insist.

547
00:30:50,999 --> 00:30:51,999
After you.

548
00:30:52,680 --> 00:30:53,680
That'll do.

549
00:31:27,039 --> 00:31:28,160
Are you Mr. Chen Wan?

550
00:31:28,920 --> 00:31:29,440
Mr. Chen,

551
00:31:29,441 --> 00:31:30,958
please cooperate with our
investigation on a case.

552
00:31:30,959 --> 00:31:31,959
This way, please.
